      "body": "**Shàngdì** ​belongs ‌‌to ​the ​Chinese ​​tradition, ​where ‌it ​​is ‌associated ​with ‌supreme ​‌deity, ​heaven, ​sovereign.[^1]\n\n​​### ​Supreme ‌Deity\n\n​‌The ​central ‌domain ​‌of ​Shàngdì ‌in ​​the ‌chinese ‌tradition.\n\n‌### ​​Highest ‌Emperor; ​the ​‌supreme ​god ​of ‌​earl\n\n‌The ​name ​​signifies ​\"Highest ‌Emperor; ‌​the ‌supreme ​god ​of ‌‌early ‌Chinese ‌religion\".\n\n​‌### ​Unicode ​Restoration\n\n​‌The ​restoration ​Shàngdì ​‌recovers ​what ​plain ​‌ASCII ​shangdi ‌flattens.\n\n​### ‌​Original ‌Attestation\n\n‌Attested ​​in ​the ​sources ‌‌as ​上帝.",
